+
+Checks: official obligation attempt 1 failed compilation (reserved invariant identifier); direct compilation then identified spec-mode borrowing and ghost assignment. Repaired with core_ok, tracked proof references and ghost field updates. Official obligation attempt 2 passed build, all eight seed-1 tests and all four proofs. Official final runs/checks/1793495300732175752 returned REQUEST_VOTE_CHECKS_PASSED: build/inventory/source boundary, eight tests on each seed 1–5, rules 26/0, history 30/0, confirmed 32/0, pending 32/0 verified/errors. No rollback or imported candidate was used. Current bounded task has no remaining failed dependency; controller recheck and semantic review remain separate. Next obstacle outside this task: unverified host correspondence, arbitrary crash recovery and global Raft behavior.
